{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2019-12-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'KROGER LAUNCHES DARK KITCHEN PARTNERSHIP WITH CLUSTERTRUCK IN COLUMBUS, DENVER AND INDIANAPOLIS', 'text': 'THE KROGER CO. AND CLUSTERTRUCK LAUNCHED A PARTNERSHIP THAT WILL CHANGE THE WAY AMERICANS ACCESS FRESHLY PREPARED MEALS. BY OFFERING MULTIPLE MENUS FROM ONE CENTRAL SCRATCH KITCHEN, KROGER DELIVERY KITCHEN WILL DELIVER FRESH AND DELICIOUS MEALS ON-DEMAND WITHOUT SERVICE OR DELIVERY FEES. FOR THE INITIAL ROLLOUT, KROGER DELIVERY KITCHEN POWERED BY CLUSTERTRUCK IS LAUNCHING IN CARMEL, INDIANA – WHERE KROGER AND CLUSTERTRUCK ARE JOINTLY OPENING A FOURTH KITCHEN – AND INDIANAPOLIS AND COLUMBUS, OHIO. ADDITIONALLY, KING SOOPERS DELIVERY KITCHEN POWERED BY CLUSTERTRUCK WILL SERVE CUSTOMERS IN DENVER. CUSTOMERS IN CARMEL, INDIANAPOLIS AND COLUMBUS DELIVERY ZONES CAN GO TO KROGERDELIVERYKITCHEN.COM TO PLACE THEIR ORDERS ONLINE OR DOWNLOAD THE CLUSTERTRUCK APP.'}